1
00:00:00,147 --> 00:00:03,217
(Amy:)Okay, so how do you feel
about party balloons?

2
00:00:03,217 --> 00:00:04,847
(Sheldon:)Uh, Mylar balloons, yes.

3
00:00:04,852 --> 00:00:06,452
(Sheldon:)Latex balloons, no.

4
00:00:06,453 --> 00:00:08,583
(Sheldon:)Water balloons,
I will jump off the roof

5
00:00:08,589 --> 00:00:10,789
(Sheldon:)and aim for your car.

6
00:00:11,792 --> 00:00:13,892
(Penny:)All right, what about music?

7
00:00:13,894 --> 00:00:15,294
(Sheldon:)I enjoy marching bands

8
00:00:15,295 --> 00:00:18,035
(Sheldon:)and Tibetan throat singing.

9
00:00:18,032 --> 00:00:19,462
(Penny:)No music it is.

10
00:00:20,734 --> 00:00:22,064
(Bernadette:)What kind of cake
do you like?

11
00:00:22,069 --> 00:00:24,999
Well, my favorite is chocolate
with strawberry frosting,

12
00:00:25,005 --> 00:00:26,875
(Sheldon:)three layers,
and if there's

13
00:00:26,874 --> 00:00:28,644
(Sheldon:)writing on it,
make sure it's not all caps.

14
00:00:28,642 --> 00:00:32,142
(Sheldon:)I don't need my dessert
yelling at me.

15
00:00:34,148 --> 00:00:37,218
(Raj:)Hey, so what was
Adam West like on the phone?

16
00:00:37,217 --> 00:00:38,517
(Leonard:)Uh, nice guy.

17
00:00:38,519 --> 00:00:40,219
(Leonard:)But it was a little weird
to hear Batman say,

18
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:44,160
“Don't ring the doorbell
or my poodles will go crazy.”

19
00:00:44,158 --> 00:00:47,158
(Raj:)You know, Adam West
is my favorite Batman?

20
00:00:47,161 --> 00:00:48,461
(Scene:)Well,

21
00:00:48,462 --> 00:00:50,792
(Raj:)after Michael Keaton,
Christian Bale

22
00:00:50,798 --> 00:00:53,028
(Raj:)and Batman from
The Lego Movie.

23
00:00:54,301 --> 00:00:55,601
(Howard:)Don't say that to him.

24
00:00:55,602 --> 00:00:57,972
(Raj:)What?
He beat out George Clooney.

25
00:00:57,971 --> 00:00:58,971
(Raj:)And that's something.

